              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugabo we, agenda urugendo rw’umusi umwe mu bugaragwa, araza yicara musi y’igiti c’umurotemu, yisabira gupfa, at’ Ewe Uhoraho, ivyanje ni bigarukire hano: ntabara unkūreho, kuko ntaruta ba sogokuruza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyak 12:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Araheza yiryamira musi y’ico giti c’umurotemu, arasinzira; maz’ umumarayika araza aramukoma, aramubarira, ati Vyuka, urye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanuye, abona umutsima ugeretse ku makara, n’umukuza w’ amazi, biri haruguru y’umutwe wiwe. Nukw aravyābīra, ararya, aranywa, arongera ariryamira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umumarayika w’Uhoraho agaruka ubugira kabiri, aramukoma, aramubarira, ati Vyuka urye, urugendo ntirukunanire kukw ari rurerure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.3.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 3:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.24.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "24:18",
