              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arishura, ati Nagize ishaka ryinshi ryawe, Uhoraho Mana Nyen’ ingabo; kukw Abisirayeli bavuye mw isezerano ryawe, bagahomvagura ibicaniro vyawe, kandi bicishije inkota abavugishwa nawe; ni jewe jenyene nsigaye, nanje nyene barangenza ngo banyice. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
