        {
          "text": "Nukw avayo, aragenda abona Elisa mwene Shafati, arikw ararimisha inka mirongwibiri na zine zirongōye imbere yiwe, zisangiye ingōgo ari zibiri‐zibiri, na we ari ku z’imperēra; Eliya akebereza iy’ ari, amutererak’ umutamana wiwe. ",
